<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1956353284"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1700471774"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Over Again"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="2NATURAL / lama / Wendy Wang 美辰"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Over Again"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="02:41.850"><div begin="00:01.210" end="02:41.850"><p begin="00:01.210" end="00:03.710" itunes:key="L1">Told my friends I'm tired<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">告诉朋友们我已疲惫不堪</span></p><p begin="00:03.710" end="00:06.340" itunes:key="L2">Need a hug from you and<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只想要你一个拥抱</span></p><p begin="00:06.340" end="00:11.460" itunes:key="L3">I've been pacing around<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我一直在徘徊不安</span></p><p begin="00:11.460" end="00:13.820" itunes:key="L4">Couldn't reach you last night<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">昨晚无法联系到你</span></p><p begin="00:13.820" end="00:16.030" itunes:key="L5">Don't know if your phone died<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不知是你手机没电</span></p><p begin="00:16.030" end="00:21.530" itunes:key="L6">Or if you're drunk and forgot you had to kiss me goodnight<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还是你喝醉后忘记</span></p><p begin="00:21.530" end="00:23.910" itunes:key="L7">Don't know when it started<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不知从何时开始</span></p><p begin="00:23.910" end="00:33.470" itunes:key="L8">Don't know when I became so weak<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不知为何我变得如此脆弱</span></p><p begin="00:33.470" end="00:36.520" itunes:key="L9">Overanalyzing every breath that you take<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的每一次呼吸</span></p><p begin="00:36.520" end="00:41.430" itunes:key="L10">I'm wishing, I'm wishing that I would stop caring<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我多希望我能停止在意</span></p><p begin="00:41.430" end="00:46.630" itunes:key="L11">I gave you all of my mind, wrote it out on those lines<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我倾尽了我的心思</span></p><p begin="00:46.630" end="00:51.580" itunes:key="L12">All I get from you are two-letter replies<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而你却只给我简短的回应</span></p><p begin="00:51.580" end="00:56.550" itunes:key="L13">I gave you all of my pride so I can still call you mine<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我放下了所有的自尊</span></p><p begin="00:56.550" end="01:03.260" itunes:key="L14">But you just give up on us over and over again<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但你却一次次放弃我们之间的感情</span></p><p begin="01:21.990" end="01:24.540" itunes:key="L15">Something's off in your tone<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的语气中有些不对劲</span></p><p begin="01:24.540" end="01:27.190" itunes:key="L16">Should I leave you alone?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我是否该让你独自静一静</span></p><p begin="01:27.190" end="01:32.270" itunes:key="L17">Are you busy, or do you just not wanna talk?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是真的忙碌，还是根本不想交谈</span></p><p begin="01:32.270" end="01:34.780" itunes:key="L18">Every time that we fight<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">每次我们争吵</span></p><p begin="01:34.780" end="01:37.280" itunes:key="L19">You just turn a blind eye<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你总是选择视而不见</span></p><p begin="01:37.280" end="01:42.200" itunes:key="L20">I was crying, but you told me that you're going to bed<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我在哭泣 你却告诉我你要去睡觉了</span></p><p begin="01:42.200" end="01:44.830" itunes:key="L21">Don't know when it started<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不知从何时开始</span></p><p begin="01:44.830" end="01:52.370" itunes:key="L22">Don't know when you became so impatient<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不知你何时变得如此不耐烦</span></p><p begin="01:52.370" end="01:54.960" itunes:key="L23">You're good at finding reasons<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你总是擅长找借口</span></p><p begin="01:54.960" end="01:57.360" itunes:key="L24">Downplay all my feelings<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">轻描淡写我的感受</span></p><p begin="01:57.360" end="02:02.210" itunes:key="L25">You say that I'm just too unstable<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你说我只是太情绪化</span></p><p begin="02:02.210" end="02:07.540" itunes:key="L26">I gave you all of my mind, wrote it out on those lines<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我倾尽了我的心思</span></p><p begin="02:07.540" end="02:12.320" itunes:key="L27">All I get from you are two-letter replies<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">而你却只给我简短的回应</span></p><p begin="02:12.320" end="02:17.370" itunes:key="L28">I gave you all of my pride so I can still call you mine<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我放下了所有的自尊</span></p><p begin="02:17.370" end="02:23.540" itunes:key="L29">But you just give up on us over and over again<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但你却一次次放弃我们之间的感情</span></p><p begin="02:40.120" end="02:41.850" itunes:key="L30">Over and over again<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一次又一次地放弃</span></p></div></body></tt>